        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031660/extras/c6d3c70c7bff2f05fb724a6b725cdced.poster.avif?t=1767846985\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031660/extras/c6d3c70c7bff2f05fb724a6b725cdced.webm?t=1767846985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031660/extras/c6d3c70c7bff2f05fb724a6b725cdced.mp4?t=1767846985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vessel</strong> is a short, experimental horror experience that immerses you in a bleak and unsettling atmosphere. <br>Designed to be completed in 15–20 minutes, the game is meant to be played in one uninterrupted session. There are no saves — once you begin, you must play it through to the end.</p>",
